      <img src="/assets/stem-logo.png" alt="STEM logo" class="brand-logo-img" />
      <div class="brand-text-stack">
        <span class="brand-text">STEM Tesla <strong>BioHub</strong></span>
        <span class="brand-sub">Dangcagan National High School</span>
      </div>
    </a>
    <nav class="site-nav" aria-label="Sections">
      <a href="/about">About</a>
      <a href="/login" class="nav-cta">Sign in</a>
    </nav>
  </div>
</header>

<main>
  <section class="hero">
    <div class="hero-bg-grid"></div>
    <div class="container hero-inner">
      <div class="hero-brand-row">
        <img src="/assets/stem-logo.png" alt="STEM logo" class="hero-logo-img" />
        <div class="hero-brand-meta">
          <p class="hero-kicker">Biology 2 · Class Study Hub · SY 2026&ndash;2027</p>
          <p class="hero-school">Dangcagan National High School · STEM &mdash; Tesla strand</p>
        </div>
      </div>
      <p class="hero-tagline">Explore. Practice. Apply. <span class="tagline-accent">Discover Biology.</span></p>
      <p class="hero-sub">The study hub for Tesla STEM Biology 2 &mdash; organized notes, practice quizzes, flashcards, and live tests in one place.</p>
      <div class="hero-cta-row">
        <a href="/login" class="btn btn-primary btn-lg">Sign in</a>
        <a href="/about" class="btn btn-outline btn-lg">Learn more</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section landing-section">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="landing-tabs" role="tablist" aria-label="About BioHub">
        <button class="landing-tab active" data-tab="about" role="tab" aria-selected="true">Overview</button>
        <button class="landing-tab" data-tab="features" role="tab" aria-selected="false">Features</button>
        <button class="landing-tab" data-tab="how" role="tab" aria-selected="false">How it works</button>
      </div>

      <div class="landing-tab-panel active" id="tab-about" role="tabpanel">
        <p>BioHub brings together everything the Biology 2 class needs &mdash; organized notes, practice quizzes you can repeat anytime, flashcards for quick review, and live tests hosted by your teacher.</p>
        <p>Sign in to track your progress, keep a daily streak, and climb the weekly leaderboard. Your work is saved to your account so you can pick up where you left off on any device.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="landing-tab-panel" id="tab-features" role="tabpanel" hidden>
        <div class="landing-feature-grid">
          <div class="landing-feature">
            <h3><span class="feat-icon"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M2 3h6a4 4 0 0 1 4 4v14a3 3 0 0 0-3-3H2z"/><path d="M22 3h-6a4 4 0 0 0-4 4v14a3 3 0 0 1 3-3h7z"/></svg></span> Notes</h3>
            <p>Units and parts built from a block editor &mdash; paragraphs, headings, lists, images, dividers, callouts.</p>
          </div>
          <div class="landing-feature">
            <h3><span class="feat-icon"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M12 2a3 3 0 0 0-3 3 3 3 0 0 0-3 3 3 3 0 0 0-1 5.83V17a3 3 0 0 0 3 3 3 3 0 0 0 4 0 3 3 0 0 0 4 0 3 3 0 0 0 3-3v-3.17A3 3 0 0 0 18 8a3 3 0 0 0-3-3 3 3 0 0 0-3-3z"/></svg></span> Practice Quizzes</h3>
            <p>Unlimited retries, randomized items and options, instant scoring with explanations.</p>
          </div>
          <div class="landing-feature">
            <h3><span class="feat-icon"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><polygon points="13 2 3 14 12 14 11 22 21 10 12 10 13 2"/></svg></span> Flashcards</h3>
            <p>Flip-card review with per-card scoring. Bulk-add mode for teachers &mdash; paste front|back lines and create a deck in seconds.</p>
          </div>
          <div class="landing-feature">
            <h3><span class="feat-icon"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="2"/><path d="M16.24 7.76a6 6 0 0 1 0 8.49M7.76 16.24a6 6 0 0 1 0-8.49M19.07 4.93a10 10 0 0 1 0 14.14M4.93 19.07a10 10 0 0 1 0-14.14"/></svg></span> Live Tests</h3>
            <p>Teacher hosts a quiz and the class answers in real time. Items and options are randomized per student.</p>
          </div>
          <div class="landing-feature">
            <h3><span class="feat-icon"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M6 9H4.5a2.5 2.5 0 0 1 0-5H6"/><path d="M18 9h1.5a2.5 2.5 0 0 0 0-5H18"/><path d="M4 22h16"/><path d="M10 14.66V17c0 .55-.47.98-.97 1.21C7.85 18.75 7 20.24 7 22"/><path d="M14 14.66V17c0 .55.47.98.97 1.21C16.15 18.75 17 20.24 17 22"/><path d="M18 2H6v7a6 6 0 0 0 12 0V2z"/></svg></span> Streaks &amp; Leaderboard</h3>
            <p>Daily streaks, weekly and all-time leaderboards. A fresh weekly cycle starts every Monday.</p>
          </div>
          <div class="landing-feature">
            <h3><span class="feat-icon"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><rect x="2" y="3" width="20" height="14" rx="2"/><line x1="8" y1="21" x2="16" y2="21"/><line x1="12" y1="17" x2="12" y2="21"/></svg></span> Installable</h3>
            <p>Install BioHub on your phone or laptop. Notes, practice, flashcards, and leaderboard are app shortcuts.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="landing-tab-panel" id="tab-how" role="tabpanel" hidden>
        <ol class="how-list">
          <li><strong>Get your sign-in.</strong> Students use their LRN; advisers use their assigned identifier. Ask your teacher if you are not sure which one applies to you.</li>
          <li><strong>Sign in.</strong> Type your identifier and password. The app routes you to the right page based on your role.</li>
          <li><strong>Personalize.</strong> Set a display name, pick an avatar color, and upload a photo from your profile.</li>
          <li><strong>Study.</strong> Read notes, take practice quizzes, review flashcards, and join live tests when your teacher hosts one.</li>
          <li><strong>Track progress.</strong> Your points, streak, and attempts are saved to your account. The leaderboard resets every Monday.</li>
        </ol>
        <p class="muted small">Forgot your password? Ask your teacher to reset it. Your progress is preserved.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</main>

<footer class="site-footer">
  <div class="container footer-inner">
    <div class="brand">
      <img src="/assets/stem-logo.png" alt="STEM logo" class="brand-logo-img" />
      <div>
        <div class="brand-text">STEM Tesla BioHub</div>
        <div class="footer-meta">Dangcagan National High School · Biology 2 · SY 2026&ndash;2027</div>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="footer-tagline">Explore. Practice. Apply. Discover Biology.</div>
  </div>
</footer>

<script>
  // Landing tab switcher — vanilla JS, no dependencies.
  document.querySelectorAll('.landing-tab').forEach(tab => {
    tab.addEventListener('click', () => {
      document.querySelectorAll('.landing-tab').forEach(t => {
        t.classList.remove('active');
        t.setAttribute('aria-selected', 'false');
      });
      tab.classList.add('active');
      tab.setAttribute('aria-selected', 'true');
      document.querySelectorAll('.landing-tab-panel').forEach(p => {
        p.hidden = true;
        p.classList.remove('active');
      });
      const target = document.getElementById('tab-' + tab.dataset.tab);
      target.hidden = false;
      target.classList.add('active');
    });
  });
</script>
